## Execution

Optional. Add steps when sequencing, dependencies, uncertainty, coordination, or recovery needs them,
when a long run's earlier context will be summarized before it finishes, or when a plan is requested. Detail
the next increment; expand later steps only to resolve a dependency or answer a planning request. Revise the approach from evidence within the agreement
and authorization. Reuse valid results and update changed facts; do not add a log entry for every loop
iteration. For an explicit planning-only request, stop before implementation. Add Work items only when the user
asks to split the change; the table selects and authorizes no item.

